OL,5,G2300 Adolf Hitler's War
OL,6,     FA Superhuman Act of Inhumanity:
OL,7,     FBetrayed, Stalin fights the German
OL,8,     Farmy in the Soviet states. The
OL,9,     FGerman occupation policies lead to
OL,10,     Fthe first extermination policies
OL,11,     Fof 'undesirables'.
OL,12,G0000 Adolf Hitler's War
OL,13,     FMoscow Is Behind Us: As Hitler's
OL,14,     Ftroops advance, occupants in
OL,15,     FUkraine, Belarus and Poland take
OL,16,     Fthe brunt of the occupying forces
OL,17,     Fcruelty; and the first
OL,18,     Fconcentration camps are created.
